.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQczEwM016VHFDZWNISGVkTE55bWljbmdVVGs0YTJwMEdwWTltYi13bHZib1hPRmVPYTFpNGRURk9aNTQxdlNzeFl3WXZwZEp6N0ZIeGk0dFFSYnJSMjM0Yzd2U3hrdnRqVU4wVWl2cURRY3ZUT0VJdjVTZFRPdUw4TjNvN0lXellNdTFHVmVNdkJvZk4tY19RRnJaOGN5dw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"由於季度收益下降，Eversource 上調 2026 年利潤預期"},{"title":"Eversource Energy (ES) Slips to $67.48 as Utility Shares Consolidate Below Resistance - Continuation Pattern Picks","src":"https://www.siam.in/","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNWUFNbUZhZThqZWdFZ0thdUtOZEVKUGJyTFU3YlFSNjAzNGlEdTh0Z2M1dVVoMVNNdVl0cFlCTUlYa3VGXzBOYWNPUUs3Q0RZMk4wZHlJMjYxYTYyZnhRN1gxS3lVckhkWkxTR2VfamRLaHpFekxBRExJZDZBYWZQTDVEeWdCUVV4NnpuMVBxRTNXdjFUMnN2eFlMbXpWN3R5VWRPb3ExbldGVk5oVmd4X0E4U2Mtb1hvU1NsRzA3MTFMQTQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"由於公用事業股在阻力位下方盤整，Eversource Energy (ES) 跌至 67.48 美元 - 持續模式選擇"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":8},{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/72741/000162828026008461/es-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Eversource Energy (Eversource), headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts and Hartford, Connecticut, is a public utility holding company subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) under the Public Utility Holding Company Act of 2005. We are engaged primarily in the energy delivery business through the following wholly-owned utility subsidiaries:","zh":"Eversource Energy (Eversource) 總部位於麻薩諸塞州波士頓和康乃狄克州哈特福德，是一家公用事業控股公司，根據 2005 年公用事業控股公司法，受聯邦能源管理委員會 (FERC) 的監管。我們主要透過以下全資公用事業子公司從事能源輸送業務："},{"en":"The Connecticut Light and Power Company (CL&P), a regulated electric utility that serves residential, commercial and industrial customers in parts of Connecticut;","zh":"康乃狄克照明電力公司 (CL&P)，受監管的電力公司，為康乃狄克州部分地區的住宅、商業和工業客戶提供服務；"},{"en":"NSTAR Electric Company (NSTAR Electric), a regulated electric utility that serves residential, commercial and industrial customers in parts of eastern and western Massachusetts and owns solar power facilities, and its wholly-owned subsidiary Harbor Electric Energy Company (HEEC), also a regulated electric utility that distributes electric energy to its sole customer;","zh":"NSTAR Electric Company (NSTAR Electric) 是一家受監管的電力公司，為馬薩諸塞州東部和西部部分地區的住宅、商業和工業客戶提供服務，並擁有太陽能發電設施，其全資子公司 Harbour Electric Energy Company (HEEC) 也是一家受監管的電力公司，向其唯一客戶分配電能；"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"As noted above, CL&P does not own any generation assets and purchases energy supply to serve its SS and LRS loads from a variety of competitive sources through requests for proposals. During 2025, CL&P supplied approximately 50 percent of its customer load at SS or LRS rates while the other 50 percent of its customer load had migrated to competitive energy suppliers. In terms of the total number of CL&P customers, this equates to 19 percent being on competitive supply, while 81 percent remain with SS or LRS. Because customer migration is limited to energy supply service, it has no impact on CL&P's electric distribution business or its operating income.","zh":"如上所述，CL&P 不擁有任何發電資產，而是透過徵求建議書從各種競爭性來源購買能源供應，為其 SS 和 LRS 負載提供服務。 2025 年，CL&P 以 SS 或 LRS 費率供應約 50% 的客戶負載，而另外 50% 的客戶負載已轉移到有競爭力的能源供應商。就 CL&P 客戶總數而言，這相當於 19% 的客戶採用競爭性供應，而 81% 的客戶仍採用 SS 或 LRS。由於客戶遷移僅限於能源供應服務，因此對CL&P的配電業務及其營業收入沒有影響。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Eversource Electric Distribution","val":10039600000,"zh":"永源電力分配"},{"name":"Natural Gas Distribution","val":2634800000,"zh":"天然氣配送"},{"name":"Eversource Electric Transmission","val":2466500000,"zh":"永源電力傳動"},{"name":"Water Distribution","val":250700000,"zh":"配水部門"},{"name":"Eversource Water","val":236900000,"zh":"永源水務"}],"total":13547244000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Retail Sales Revenue","val":11520400000,"zh":"零售銷售總收入"},{"name":"Residential","val":6858200000,"zh":"住宅"},{"name":"Commercial","val":4051900000,"zh":"商業的"},{"name":"Wholesale Market Sales Revenue","val":1193100000,"zh":"批發市場銷售收入"},{"name":"Wholesale Transmission Revenue","val":665300000,"zh":"批發傳輸收入"},{"name":"Industrial","val":610300000,"zh":"工業的"},{"name":"Other Revenue Adjustmentsfrom Contractswith Customers","val":114300000,"zh":"與客戶簽訂的合約的其他收入調整"}],"total":13547244000}},"peers":["EVRG","WEC","LNT","CMS","PNW"]}}